    "外部モニター": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "External Monitor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外部モニターが見つかりません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No external monitor found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外部モニターを HiDPI（Retina）で表示します。\n内蔵ディスプレイを、標準の設定より広く使うこともできます。\n\nhidpi-mirror（Petr Baudis、MIT License）の処理を使っています。\nhttps://github.com/pasky/hidpi-mirror": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows your external monitor in HiDPI (Retina).\nIt can also give your built-in display more space than the standard settings.\n\nBased on hidpi-mirror by Petr Baudis (MIT License).\nhttps://github.com/pasky/hidpi-mirror"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "終了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit Mitame"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見た目の大きさ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looks Like"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
